{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/watters/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"fb30d0d9-fb8b-505f-ae87-e02325843302","strapi_id":39,"ShortDescription":"Watters designs gowns that blend comfort, style, and a touch of drama. For the bride who wants something beautifully made and unmistakably her.","PriceRangeLow":"210000","PriceRangeHigh":"340000","Name":"WATTERS","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"It all began back in 1986, when founder Vatana Watters realized that brides deserved more than the gowns they were finding in stores. After designing custom dresses for herself, friends, and family, she took a vow to create something different–bridal that felt personal, expressive, and beautifully made. "}]},{"children":[{"text":"Today, Watters has grown into a family-led creative house of designers, pattern makers, and expert seamstresses. Their focus remains the same: understand fashion, sense what’s next, and design for how brides truly want to feel. Think refined drama, effortless comfort, modern style, versatility, and individuality–all wrapped into gowns that invite brides to show up as their most radiant selves."}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#584848","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/6752c/watters_desktop_9e1461df43.jpg","srcSet":"/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/beb21/watters_desktop_9e1461df43.jpg 224w,\n/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/f4a75/watters_desktop_9e1461df43.jpg 448w,\n/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/6752c/watters_desktop_9e1461df43.jpg 896w","sizes":"(min-width: 896px) 896px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/d259d/watters_desktop_9e1461df43.webp 224w,\n/static/62295fd7f6cfabef36b761eee8d8b2ed/95de3/wat